  "description": "Framework-agnostic authentication core for Zonit applications. AddAuthExtension() registers the scoped IAuthenticatedProvider / IAuthenticatedRepository pair that carries the current Identity through a unit of work (request, Blazor circuit or background job), plus no-op defaults for the two consumer-implemented adapters: IAuthSource (token to Identity) and the optional IUserDirectory (UserModel lookups). Identity, Permission and Role come from Zonit.Extensions. No ASP.NET Core dependency - cookie hydration, the authentication scheme, authorization handlers and the Blazor AuthenticationStateProvider live in Zonit.Extensions.Website and are wired by AddWebsite().",
